# Who owns what, and who to ask.
#
# This is a solo project: one maintainer owns every area. The file exists so a
# successor knows that for a fact rather than inferring it from the git log, and
# so GitHub requests a review automatically if a second contributor ever appears.
#
# Maintainer: Swift Struck — alaap@swiftstruck.com — @alaap-swift-struck

# Everything, unless a more specific rule below matches.
*                       @alaap-swift-struck

# Layer 0 — the design tokens. Changing a value here re-skins every component and
# can silently break contrast; read registry/tokens/README.md first.
/styles.css             @alaap-swift-struck
/registry/tokens/       @alaap-swift-struck

# Layers 1 and 2 — the shipped library.
/registry/primitives/   @alaap-swift-struck
/registry/collections/  @alaap-swift-struck
/lib/                   @alaap-swift-struck

# The docs and showcase harness — not shipped to consumers.
/www/                   @alaap-swift-struck

# Contract documents. Changes here change how everything else is built.
/ARCHITECTURE.md        @alaap-swift-struck
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @alaap-swift-struck
/OPERATIONS.md          @alaap-swift-struck
